\section{Calibration Datasets}
\label{sec:datasets}
%==============================================================================

The HQI-SAC-Fed framework is calibrated on 16{,}444{,}284 records from seven publicly available benchmark datasets, ensuring that all stochastic parameters, economic assumptions, and physical constraints reflect empirical rather than assumed distributions. Table~\ref{tab:datasets} summarises the dataset suite.

