\midrule
NREL Wind Toolkit NS Atlantic & NREL~\cite{draxl2015wind} & 5{,}913{,}000 & CF $= 0.481$, Weibull $k{=}2.31$, $c{=}10.18$\,m/s & Draxl~\textit{et~al.} 2015 \\
NREL NSRDB Atlantic Solar TMY & NREL~\cite{sengupta2018nsrdb} & 2{,}628{,}900 & CF $= 0.192$, GHI $= 1{,}324$\,kWh/m$^2$/yr & Sengupta~\textit{et~al.} 2018 \\
IESO/AESO Canadian Markets & IESO/AESO~\cite{ieso_data, aeso_data} & 1{,}314{,}000 & Price $\mu = \$84.3$/MWh, $\sigma = \$29.7$ & IESO/AESO 2024 \\
